308	    // Dedup by (kind, name): a state invariant and a transition invariant may
309	    // legitimately share a name; keying on the name alone would hide one.
310	    // NOTE the consequence for seeded runs: ONE witness per invariant — the
311	    // first root (init, then seeds in input order) whose region reaches the
312	    // violation. The verdict is "compatible or not", not the affected-instance
313	    // list; callers must not read a single named seed as the blast radius.
