449	    // states in the graph (LLM-generated legacy specs routinely return
450	    // undefined for an unhandled action). Object.keys/`in` would throw and
451	    // turn that spec's REAL violations into a checker crash — skip the scan
452	    // for such degenerate graphs; the violations themselves still report.
