3	// SAM v2 strict-profile specification of src/core.ts, over three carts "a", "b"
4	// and "c" (three, so that returns can push charges against the limit of 4).
5	// A cart that was never opened has status 'none'. The network is `net`: the
6	// sorted list of messages in transit, each written "from>to:Action[:n]" where
7	// n is the Reserve/Release qty or the Charge/Refund amount.
